OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F331A1786997937
OL,3,CMan admits murdering mum-of-six
OL,5,FA man who killed a 33-year-old mother-
OL,6,Fof-six in an attack at a house in
OL,7,FHuddersfield has pleaded guilty to her
OL,8,Fmurder.
OL,10,FPolice were called to Fernside Avenue
OL,11,Fin Almondbury at about 12.26am on 19
OL,12,FDecember to a report of serious
OL,13,Fassault and found Lisa Smith with
OL,14,Fserious head injuries.
OL,16,FShe died in hospital two days later.
OL,18,FInitially charged with section 18
OL,19,Fassault, 34-year-old Gareth Brook was
OL,20,Flater charged with murder following
OL,21,FLisa's death.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G1/4
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
