FL,332,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33102
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F331A1786997937
OL,3,CMan admits murdering mum-of-six
OL,5,FAt a pre-trial preparation hearing at
OL,6,FLeeds Crown Court on Monday 17 August,
OL,7,FBrook, of Fernside Avenue, admitted
OL,8,Fmurdering her.
OL,10,FDetective Inspector Tom Hilyer, who
OL,11,Fled the investigation, said:
OL,13,F"We welcome the guilty plea of Gareth
OL,14,FBrook today for what was a dreadful
OL,15,Fattack in which he inflicted extremely
OL,16,Fserious head injuries on Lisa.
OL,18,F"Those injuries tragically left her
OL,19,Fwith no realistic prospect of survival.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G2/4
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,332,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33103
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F331A1786997937
OL,3,CMan admits murdering mum-of-six
OL,5,F"We hope Lisa's family can take some
OL,6,Fsmall measure of comfort from seeing
OL,7,Fhim admit his guilt in court today,
OL,8,Fand we continue to support them at
OL,9,Fwhat remains an incredibly traumatic
OL,10,Ftime."
OL,12,FSpeaking in December last year, Lisa
OL,13,FSmith's family said that in her last
OL,14,Fmoments she took part in organ
OL,15,Fdonation.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G3/4
