FL,332,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33104
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F331A1786997937
OL,3,CMan admits murdering mum-of-six
OL,5,FHer mother said: "This is one of the
OL,6,Fhardest things I have ever had to
OL,7,Fshare. Lisa Jane Louise Smith fell to
OL,8,Fsleep at 17:28 on the 21/12/2025. I
OL,9,Ftucked her in tightly and kissed her
OL,10,Fgoodnight.
OL,12,F"Lisa had one final party she needed
OL,13,Fto attend to make sure she could
OL,14,Fspread some Christmas magic. She did
OL,15,Fwhat she does best by helping other
OL,16,Ffamilies have a special Christmas
OL,17,Funtil she fell fast asleep."
OL,19,FBrook will be sentenced at a later
OL,20,Fdate.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G4/4
